source edit, test/gate/plan review, claim, transition, close, code commit, or manual push occurred; these planning updates and this receipt are normal MCP ticket-event mutations auto-committed and auto-pushed by rebar.","timestamp":1788626987315194306},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Planning receipt — next four comment-remediation children\n\nImmutable audit basis: `d6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84` (also the clean code-worktree HEAD and `origin/main` during preparation).\n\nSelection/ranking:\n- Rechecked the 14 eligible open, unassigned direct children and ranked them by declared file-impact breadth, preserving the audited order for ties.\n- Selected the first four: `talkable-marmatite-agouti` (10 files), `doddered-undercover-alligator` (11), `fishy-dinky-urus` (11), and `dripping-captious-arctichare` (17). Every remaining ranked candidate had 18 files.\n- Live MCP preflight immediately before editing confirmed all four were still open, unassigned, unsigned, had no retained plan-review result, and remained direct children of `hopeful-deserved-needletail`.\n\nAudited prose inventory:\n- `talkable-marmatite-agouti`: 142 editable blocks; 25 protected directive/shebang lines; final description 6,963 chars.\n- `doddered-undercover-alligator`: 130 editable blocks; 25 protected directive/shebang lines; final description 6,999 chars.\n- `fishy-dinky-urus`: 99 editable blocks; 7 protected directive/shebang lines; final description 5,592 chars.\n- `dripping-captious-arctichare`: 198 editable blocks; 39 protected directive/shebang lines; final description 7,849 chars.\nAll descriptions are below the 8,000-character review admission cap. Stable IDs are unique and span-qualified; owner/spans and file-impact order were validated; every impact path has a reason.\n\nCorrections and protected consumers:\n- Replaced the former stale prose-audit basis with the immutable SHA above and audited current